        "id": "MaokaiPassive",
        "name": "Sap Magic",
        "summary": "Maokai's basic attack also heals him and deals additional damage on a moderate cooldown. Each time Maokai casts a spell or is struck by an enemy's spell, this cooldown is reduced.",
