        "bodyHtml": "Maokai smashes his fist into the ground, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(75/120/165/210/255 + (50% Ability Power)) plus 2/2.5/3/3.5/4% max Health magic damage</span> and briefly <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span>. Nearby enemies are also <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocked Back</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">This Ability deals an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">150/160/170/180/190 magic damage</span> to jungle monsters.</span>",
