      "E": {
        "slot": "E",
        "id": "MaokaiE",
        "name": "Sapling Toss",
        "summary": "Maokai flings a sapling to the target area to stand guard. More effective in brush.",
        "bodyHtml": "Maokai flings a sapling, which stands watch for 30 seconds. Saplings chase nearby enemies, detonating on arrival to deal <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(50/75/100/125/150 + (25% Ability Power) + (5% bonus Health)) magic damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slow</span> surrounding enemies by 45% for 2 seconds. <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Sap Magic's</span> Cooldown is reduced by an additional 4 seconds if the sapling hits an enemy champion or epic monster.<br /><br />If placed in brush, Saplings instead last for (30 + (1.5% bonus Health)) seconds and cause a larger explosion, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(100/150/200/250/300 + (50% Ability Power) + (10% bonus Health)) magic damage</span> over 2 seconds and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> enemies by (45% + (0.01% Ability Power)).<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Saplings run at 400 Move Speed. Brush saplings do not deal the increased damage to minions.</span>",
